WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.500 --> 00:00:05.000
I found my dad's wedding ring at my mom's

00:00:05.500 --> 00:00:09.480
And then I walked to the beach where Kristen was 
with a bottle of champagne at sunset

00:00:09.980 --> 00:00:11.980
And I pulled the ring out of my pocket...

00:00:12.600 --> 00:00:15.020
Oh! Did you just think that I was proposing to you?

00:00:15.020 --> 00:00:17.120
Shut the front door!
No

00:00:17.560 --> 00:00:19.020
Now it's awkward

00:00:20.820 --> 00:00:22.820
I was ready to say yes

00:00:23.180 --> 00:00:25.860
Yeah, you were. 
Are you?

00:00:25.860 --> 00:00:29.160
It just feels like a whole big thing 
that I don't really understand

00:00:29.900 --> 00:00:32.260
Maybe do a doc?

00:00:32.700 --> 00:00:34.360
Or something

00:00:36.300 --> 00:00:38.300
That's a serious camera

00:00:39.580 --> 00:00:43.360
"Domestic partnership" to me just always seemed so clinical a term

00:00:43.440 --> 00:00:47.980
Whereas "marriage" has such a resonance of love

00:00:49.680 --> 00:00:53.800
I want a lifetime partner
That, uh, Notebook sh*t

00:00:55.420 --> 00:00:56.380
Can I cuss?

00:00:56.600 --> 00:00:57.380
Yes

00:00:59.540 --> 00:01:01.520
Domestic partnership is the easy way out

00:01:01.520 --> 00:01:06.260
This is just so that I can have health insurance. 
This has nothing to do with this other conversation

00:01:06.340 --> 00:01:08.000
It does, okay? It does

00:01:08.720 --> 00:01:13.560
What kept me in our relationship was, 
"What's wrong with me that I can't love this woman for exactly who she is?"

00:01:14.340 --> 00:01:17.820
I think, more and more, this is becoming about you

00:01:18.220 --> 00:01:20.760
We're going to my dad's house

00:01:20.960 --> 00:01:22.180
He got divorced

00:01:22.300 --> 00:01:24.760
Was it hard for you to leave?

00:01:41.140 --> 00:01:43.860
You don't understand how big this is

00:01:56.240 --> 00:01:59.320
You think the water's cold?
Yep.

00:02:00.340 --> 00:02:02.460
Do you want to walk in it anyway?

